/-- Low-memory kernel check of the norm node `dA`. -/
theorem kHE3S_dA : norm3KS WtHE3 KvSHE3 NHE3 MHE3 trHE3N_dA (1, 0, 3) 126 73 55 25 11 8 10 36 27 ≤
